Changes: added the derivation of the phase factor from the Bloch equation, Bloch-simulation checks of gradient echoes and of the 180° k-space reflection, stripe-pattern and center/edge demonstrations on real data, a realistic SI-unit GRE trajectory with prephaser and rewinders, EPI/spiral gradient design with hardware limits, radial sampling density and a trajectory comparison table; ported all original code to a consistent style; fixed typos ("frequnecy", "which is differs", "use in creating", "We have now have") and clarified that a 180° pulse conjugates $M_{xy}$.*
